! Line 24 (G VODR DRZ(BU,64),16) gets NO !CHECK: its printed
! "000020.00" is the RESERVATION COUNT in the BINARY OUTPUT column
! (0o20 = 16 words), not storage contents, and there is nothing
! deposited for the oracle to read -- printed pp.84, 109, 114 and 129
! give their DRZ rows no !CHECK for exactly this reason.  Its LOCATION
! is checked, by "!SYM GVODR 217134.00", and its LENGTH is checked
! independently by line 19 and by p.138 line 44, which both Transmit
! 16.0 words to and from it.
